      "writtenOn": "2017-06-15T05:32:28Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "I think this code is different than the old code as in we don\u0027t consider current CPU frequency (capacity_curr_of) when selecting best idle CPU right?\n\nI think that should be factored too to account for the latency induced due to the fact that it may be running at low frequency and now needs to start ramping right?\n\nI know if its a big task, the frequency will be setup but the load-tracking still needs to catch up. Basically this looks to me like changing the behavior of the old code I think.",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 6272,
        "startChar": 0,
        "endLine": 6272,
        "endChar": 21
      },
      "revId": "f568a05cdb2a58e878634a200827ea06eb1289df",
