      "message": "can we add a comment here that we\u0027re trying to pack the task on a CPU (also its a bit confusing to me, could we phrase to \"Favor CPU that has minimum reserved capacity\" or something like that)\nBasically what I understand (correct me if I\u0027m wrong) is that we want to find a CPU that is packed the most by this task.",
